# APEX Dashboard Output Directory

This directory contains auto-generated APEX performance dashboard files.

**DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY** - Files are generated by CI workflow.

Generated files:
- `index.html` - Main performance trends dashboard
- `latest.html` - Latest run summary
- `data.json` - Raw data export for external tools

Dashboard URL (when deployed):
